# Only what the image needs is sent to the build. Everything else stays out, above all
# anything that could be a key or a client's data.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src
!app
!config
!.streamlit
!deploy/entrypoint.sh

# Keys never travel in the main build context. The verification key comes in through the
# separate `license` context; the signing key never comes in at all.
**/*.pem
**/*.key

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
